OL,3,GNEWSAWhat does the return of
OL,4,AColchester's old bus station mean?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe public anger surrounding the
OL,7,Fclosure of Colchester's bus station in
OL,8,F2012 was clear.
OL,10,FIn fact, 18,000 people signed a
OL,11,Fpetition demanding the site off Queen
OL,12,FStreet was saved.
OL,14,FThe station was demolished to make way
OL,15,Ffor a new cultural quarter in the town
OL,16,Fand while there were lofty ambitions
OL,17,Ffor the land, most never materialised.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
